=== getEnvAny with NEW priority (lowercase first) ===
getEnvAny("http_proxy", "HTTP_PROXY")  = "http://lower-case:3128"
getEnvAny("https_proxy", "HTTPS_PROXY") = "https://lower-case:8443"
getEnvAny("no_proxy", "NO_PROXY")      = "lower.example.com"

=== getEnvAny with OLD priority (uppercase first) ===
getEnvAny("HTTP_PROXY", "http_proxy")  = "http://UPPER-CASE:3128"
getEnvAny("HTTPS_PROXY", "https_proxy") = "https://UPPER-CASE:8443"
getEnvAny("NO_PROXY", "no_proxy")      = "UPPER.example.com"

=== COMPATIBILITY ASSESSMENT ===
PATCH changes proxy env var priority from uppercase-first to lowercase-first.
When both are set with different values, the resolved proxy changes.
BEHAVIOR CHANGE CONFIRMED: old and new resolution differ!
